# Public client config for the iOS (Capacitor) production build.
# These VITE_* values are PUBLIC client keys, identical to what already ships in
# the florrie.ai web bundle (extracted from the live deployed bundle). They are
# not secrets: Stripe publishable + Supabase anon + Sentry DSN are public by
# design, and these strings are already downloadable by any visitor to florrie.ai.
# Loaded automatically by `npm run build` (vite production mode) in Xcode Cloud's
# ci_post_clone, so the native bundle ships with the same backend config as web.
# (Without these, frontend/src/lib/config.js throws on boot -> blank screen.)
